 calendar effectively! That way, I can keep everything in one manageable place.\"}\n\nevent: response.reasoning_summary_part.done\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.reasoning_summary_part.done\",\"item_id\":\"rs_02d7509b21428b7e016af12967e73887d08bc0a885cbb4e5b7\",\"output_index\":0,\"part\":{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Planning future events**\\n\\nI think it's a good idea to anchor upcoming events. I should search for events within a broad range from January 2025 to January 2026. This also makes me consider using tools like mail and drive for managing those events. It seems that gathering all these details can help create a clearer timeline, so I'll focus on organizing this future calendar effectively! That way, I can keep everything in one manageable place.\"},\"sequence_number\":86,\"summary_index\":0}\n\nevent: response.output_item.done\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.output_item.done\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"rs_02d7509b21428b7e016af12967e73887d08bc0a885cbb4e5b7\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABq8SluMtnnZerpQf1AP_aCpwjRQOuoc9YE0S4KFn2jFEhYNei5Q7CTplyyXMyIAcuiqO4t6tmTJv0Suy2aa6QI7VFRwopab89Huu6eE7t15EL5zZ8XWdzcydgDTh7Cy0J-dHHHZISjk0uVu1gQSuaHh9l_DbgncpnI0PTSjLagyHksdIy1Sn79yOGy_bjk09-5hpe_SaCMkDXIIMVHihYDcp-8MZWsKSvGOpwbbK4F-yJEhNJ0Uwy4RRLhmS5yrm6otltzX_5c6jMfez01Re-rfeKU2Vv6ZHLN9gX1oKZzemCWvUxGBu3TFXycOo2_eb5lMNmmyxW31lCuq25m6t-PAvyowZwEawVW1syAoIfypgid2NVRBgCke_t61MwEubK59fqioBbH8F6awkTErp21WSdQgsCga-xzV4gBwSi3y68487Q1_gY5LN8yXSYXMw80wYh64fVG8dSyWD_EVRMWO7j_fPuCeCJoNxQAXxVKQmxDrrobRvZC1Y2jy--x8VhaR_YI1aVoCXfGd1U-9Y84HE91rFllSQd165tkIVZIs9dqWvHlOmNqDsFrZzsFkyZMjyOXnZNu8GbhVOHfUzJ1VJpMeXibFL7H34rLgcELTjGV92fD-Nlq4iRGakyuJ5TpqSKys9CqVOo-R3BHsu8NlbJUo315NSHSA9i23xNpzEjJlcFc5Wa3U23pcMSElGqPV373x_r6pCsQGT814EPlJhBvRYGYkGGBX4wroMXQMdLwBGpz0zjRPFBLxuWcgGBduvaWSWX9VQTUksV0Frr7Ckt6q8LGFSQ8hgIgE39NsJJ2ZW4RPkgoBlGm4ZCMazrpTLu0HtVRhUFW6olxn-BVSk6BxHmxB3340HLcftiQlzoWCVt3SgTLvLHNywC-euekeuWGE1ZZAO1kzVFzl-CUhpyA32k94QeynuAv7cAUPNW6tyJH6HOw3c