":\"output_text\",\"annotations\":[],\"logprobs\":[],\"text\":\"**Tomorrow, Tuesday, November 10, 2026 (UTC):**\\n- 9:00–9:15 AM — Team standup\\n- 2:00–3:00 PM — Q3 planning review, Room 4\\n\\nYes—Dana emailed asking you to bring the latest budget sheet to the planning review; Finance wants the Q3 travel line. I found the **Q3 Budget** spreadsheet: [Open the sheet](https://docs.example.test/spreadsheets/d/f-budget).\\n\\nI drafted a reply saying you’ll bring it and included the sheet link. **It has not been sent.**\"},\"sequence_number\":133}\n\nevent: response.output_item.done\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.output_item.done\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"msg_02d7509b21428b7e016af12978a47887d0b52cd042826bf76a\",\"type\":\"message\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"output_text\",\"annotations\":[],\"logprobs\":[],\"text\":\"**Tomorrow, Tuesday, November 10, 2026 (UTC):**\\n- 9:00–9:15 AM — Team standup\\n- 2:00–3:00 PM — Q3 planning review, Room 4\\n\\nYes—Dana emailed asking you to bring the latest budget sheet to the planning review; Finance wants the Q3 travel line. I found the **Q3 Budget** spreadsheet: [Open the sheet](https://docs.example.test/spreadsheets/d/f-budget).\\n\\nI drafted a reply saying you’ll bring it and included the sheet link. **It has not been sent.**\"}],\"phase\":\"final_answer\",\"role\":\"assistant\"},\"output_index\":1,\"sequence_number\":134}\n\nevent: response.completed\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.completed\",\"response\":{\"id\":\"resp_02d7509b21428b7e016af12976ee5487d0b38f4e34a2f223c3\",\"object\":\"response\",\"created_at\":1794189687,\"status\":\"completed\",\"access_programs\":null,\"background\":false,\"completed_at\":1794189689,\"error\":null,\"frequency_penalty\":0.0,\"image\":{\"context_compression\":\"disabled\"},\"incomplete_details\":null,\"instructions\":null,\"max_output_tokens\":128000,\"max_tool_calls\":null,\"model\":\"gpt-6-luna\",\"moderation\":null,\"output\":[{\"id\":\"rs_02d7509b21428b7e016af12977961087d08f5af